    {
      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "Spec inconsistency caught at build: the P20 plan wrote the forwarder as \u0060private static void TryDeleteAppendJournal(...) =\u003E _appendJournalWriter.TryDeleteAppendJournal(...);\u0060. _appendJournalWriter is an INSTANCE field, so the forwarder MUST be non-static (\u0060private void\u0060). All 3 call sites (:3219 recovery committed-cleanup, :3243 rollback, :3303 DeleteAppendJournal) are inside instance methods, so dropping \u0060static\u0060 is behavior-preserving with no external callers.",
