    {
      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "contentPreview": "General lesson for god-store seam extraction: whenever a store\u0027s thin forwarder delegates to an owner instance field (AppendJournalWriter, ArchiveService, etc.), the forwarder cannot remain \u0060static\u0060 \u2014 remove \u0060static\u0060 from the forwarder. Build catches it immediately (CS0120 object-reference-required).",
